@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description

title invoice.payment_status
[*] --> UNPAID : booking created
UNPAID --> PAID : SePay webhook confirms the transfer
UNPAID --> FAILED : hold expired
PAID --> REFUND_PENDING : customer cancels with a refund
REFUND_PENDING --> PAID : partner rejects the refund
REFUND_PENDING --> REFUNDED : approved, full refund
REFUND_PENDING --> PARTIALLY_REFUNDED : approved, refund after the fee
FAILED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]
PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --> [*]
legend bottom
A request made before the check-in time and still undecided at that time is approved automatically.
Dashed arrow: planned, not implemented yet.
endlegend
@enduml